flowchart TD
    Start([Round start])
    Inference[Agent inference]
    Decisions[Decisions<br/>spend · prices · VC · ops]
    State[State updates<br/>brand · capacity · research · cash]
    Market[Market share<br/>per-model softmax]
    Served[Demand served<br/>capacity-gated]
    CashUpd[Cash update<br/>revenue − burn]
    Check{Bankrupt or<br/>round limit?}
    EndN([End])

    Start --> Inference
    Inference --> Decisions
    Decisions --> State
    State --> Market
    Market --> Served
    Served --> CashUpd
    CashUpd --> Check
    Check -->|no| Start
    Check -->|yes| EndN

    Situations((⚡ Situations)):::sit -.-> State
    Situations -.-> Market

    classDef sit fill:#ffe6cc,stroke:#d79b00
